━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

APZ Wallet is the official, non-custodial wallet for APZ Chain — designed with a security-first mindset, built on a modular architecture, and crafted with a stunning neon UI. Your private keys never leave your device. No servers. No tracking. No compromises.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
✨ KEY FEATURES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

🔐 LOCAL KEY GENERATION
Generate and store your private keys entirely on your device. No server dependency. No cloud sync. Your keys, your coins.

📝 LOCAL TRANSACTION SIGNING
Every transaction is signed locally on your device using our Rust-powered crypto engine. Your private keys are never exposed to the network.

🌐 MULTI-NETWORK RPC SUPPORT
Connect to APZ Chain mainnet, testnet, and custom RPC endpoints with a single tap. Full control over your network preferences.

⚡ NEON UI EXPERIENCE
A beautiful, modern, and responsive interface with smooth animations — designed to make crypto feel effortless.

🧩 MODULAR ARCHITECTURE
Built from the ground up with modular components:
• Android (Kotlin + Jetpack Compose)
• Core (TypeScript)
• Crypto (Rust)
• Network (Go)

🌍 MULTI-LANGUAGE SUPPORT
Available in English, Persian (فارسی), and German (Deutsch). More languages coming soon.

🔍 APZ CHAIN EXPLORER
Explore transactions, addresses, and blocks directly inside the app. Full transparency at your fingertips.

